graph TB
    PM[Postmaster] -->|fork+exec| SP[Startup Process<br/>postmaster/startup.c]
    SP -->|StartupProcessMain| SPM[Register signals<br/>+ standby timeouts]
    SPM --> SX[StartupXLOG<br/>xlog.c:5384]
    SX -->|LocalProcessControlFile<br/>+ ReadControlFile| CF[(pg_control)]
    SX -->|signal files| SIG{recovery.signal?<br/>standby.signal?<br/>backup_label?}
    SIG -->|none + state=DB_IN_PRODUCTION| CR[Crash recovery]
    SIG -->|recovery.signal| AR[Archive recovery]
    SIG -->|standby.signal| ST[Standby mode]
    SIG -->|backup_label| BL[read_backup_label<br/>overrides redo start]
    CR --> IWR[InitWalRecovery<br/>xlogrecovery.c:512]
    AR --> IWR
    ST --> IWR
    BL --> IWR
    IWR -->|validateRecoveryParameters| VRP[Validate GUCs;<br/>resolve TLI]
    IWR -->|XLogReaderAllocate<br/>+ XLogPrefetcherAllocate| RDR[Reader+Prefetcher]
    IWR -->|readTimeLineHistory| TLH[(TLE history)]
    IWR -->|ReadCheckpointRecord| CP[Position at REDO start]
    SX --> PWR[PerformWalRecovery<br/>xlogrecovery.c:1652]
    PWR -->|RmgrStartup| RST[per-rmgr init]
    PWR --> LOOP{Redo loop}
    LOOP -->|ReadRecord| RR[ReadRecord<br/>via prefetcher]
    LOOP -->|recoveryPausesHere?| PAU[Pause check]
    LOOP -->|recoveryStopsBefore?| RSB[Stop predicate]
    LOOP -->|recoveryApplyDelay?| DLY[Apply-delay wait]
    LOOP -->|ApplyWalRecord| AWR[ApplyWalRecord<br/>:1908]
    AWR -->|GetRmgr.rm_redo| RM[(22 redo callbacks)]
    LOOP -->|recoveryStopsAfter?| RSA[Stop predicate]
    LOOP -->|next record| LOOP
    LOOP -->|target hit OR EOF| ACT[recovery_target_action]
    ACT -->|shutdown| EX3[proc_exit 3]
    ACT -->|pause| PAUSE[recoveryPausesHere true]
    ACT -->|promote| FWR[FinishWalRecovery<br/>:1458]
    PAUSE -->|pg_wal_replay_resume| FWR
    FWR --> RPT[RecoverPreparedTransactions]
    RPT --> EOR[Write XLOG_END_OF_RECOVERY<br/>or end-of-recovery checkpoint]
    EOR --> WTL[writeTimeLineHistory<br/>TLI bump]
    WTL --> RNP[RemoveNonParentXlogFiles]
    RNP --> UCF[UpdateControlFile<br/>state=DB_IN_PRODUCTION]
    UCF --> RSD[SharedRecoveryState<br/>= RECOVERY_STATE_DONE]
    RSD --> SWR[ShutdownWalRecovery]
    SWR -->|PMSIGNAL_RECOVERY_COMPLETED| PM
    PM -->|release backends| PROD[Production]
